    attribute isolation:String="The official make-build coordinator retains the dependency expander graph. Each private gxi calls :gerbil/compiler, owns compilation and optimizer state through native compilation, then exits. Coordinator context retirement remains unresolved.";
    attribute handoff:String="Share one official compile-module option list with the original path, including unchanged GSC tokens. invoke-gsc false and keep-scm true match the existing gxc -S contract. Private parallel false finishes native jobs before exit; make-build owns module concurrency.";
