    attribute artifactAuthority:String="Only the stage ledger copied into terminal step artifacts has producer-bound hash authority. The mutable work ledger is an observation mirror, not automatic reuse permission.";
    attribute publication:String="Use original make-build completions plus core-context-prelude readiness. Before a dependent compile, each required provider delivers its applicable SSI, native macro support and optimizer metadata. Existing outputs and unsupported requests are rejected in explicit cold mode.";
    attribute limits:String="A per-module process is not a byte bound or proof that every macro closure is small. It does not retire that child before GSC runs, retire coordinator expansion contexts, or implement persistent stage-product reuse.";
    attribute semanticGate:String="Do not automatically isolate arbitrary user macros: cross-module mutable expansion state requires an admissibility argument. Stdlib selection is a separately qualified owner.";
    attribute resourceScope:String="Limit8589934592 charged bytes across registered groups and birth-anchored POSIX sessions. A detached unregistered session remains outside qualification.";
    attribute bootstrap:String="Preserve std/build.ss initialization: eval begin-foreign including the same prefix _gambit#.scm before compile-module. Matched retained-target API controls bind1594 identical fixed inputs; uninitialized fails and initialized emits the actual protobuf module.";
    attribute customEntry:String="Reject a non-runtime GERBIL_GXC override before cold work; ordinary package make defaults remain unchanged.";
    attribute cleanup:String="Authenticate session-member births before signalling new groups. Bound pipe drain; preserve partial bytes and deny quiescence when drain is unresolved.";
    attribute qntExclusive:String="Bootstrap initialization before import, prelude/provider completion before child compile, child exit and output publication histories; no timing or emission-equivalence theorem";
